---
layout: layouts/page.njk
---
{{ content | safe }}
<h2>Care Quality Commission (CQC)</h2>
<p>The CQC regulates dental practices in England. Our current rating is: <strong>{{ site.cqc.rating | tbc | safe }}</strong>.</p>
<p>{% if site.cqc.url | isTbc %}CQC report link: {{ site.cqc.url | tbc | safe }}{% else %}<a href="{{ site.cqc.url }}">Read our latest CQC report</a>{% endif %}</p>

<h2>General Dental Council (GDC)</h2>
<p>Every dental professional at Ivy House is registered with the GDC. You can check any registration on the <a href="https://olr.gdc-uk.org/searchregister">GDC online register</a>.</p>
<table class="fee-table">
  <caption class="fee-table__caption">Our GDC-registered team</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Role</th><th scope="col">GDC number</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    {%- for c in collections.clinicians | gdcRegistered %}
    <tr><th scope="row">{% if c.url %}<a href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.data.name | tbc | safe }}</a>{% else %}{{ c.data.name | tbc | safe }}{% endif %}</th><td>{{ c.data.role }}</td><td>{{ c.data.gdc | tbc | safe }}</td></tr>
    {%- endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
